OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-.*,%-,* *,%%**,$ ,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,AMartha Stewart says she 'really screwed
OL,4,Aup' with homeless Halloween costume
OL,5,
OL,6,FShe posted a statement on Sunday saying
OL,7,Fshe was "distressed that my Halloween
OL,8,Fcostume yesterday, which was intended
OL,9,Fto bring more awareness to the very
OL,10,Fserious subject of homelessness, has
OL,11,Foffended people, which was never my
OL,12,Fintention".
OL,14,FThat was followed by a fuller apology.
OL,15,F"It's hard to admit when you've really
OL,16,Fscrewed up. My earlier statement didn't
OL,17,Fgo far enough. I know many people are
OL,18,Fsuffering economically. Wearing a
OL,19,Fcostume like I did was insensitive and
OL,20,Fnot funny. I am very sorry."
OL,23,APub: 02-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
